      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/HamieverseFDN/status/1991922127185019103",
      "text": "In 2025, 470,000 children were evacuated during just ONE typhoon in the Philippines. Schools suspended repeatedly. Education disrupted for months. \n\nIn Europe, children breathed wildfire smoke through summer \"holidays.\" In Jamaica, kids went weeks without power after Melissa. \n\nThese aren't childhood memories of playing outside, they're memories of fleeing for their lives. 48 million children globally have been affected by climate disasters since the first climate summit 30 years ago. We're raising the first generation that sees apocalyptic weather as normal.\n\nWhat kind of world are we normalizing for children when disaster drills are more common than fire drills? 😨",
